  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BioCFplus REDD+ Readiness Support MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The TF development objective is to strengthen the capacity of governments&apos; institutions engaged with developing and implementing land use activities under REDD+ (Reduced Emissions from Deforestation and forest degradation with sustainable management of forests, conservation of forest carbon stocks and enhancement of forest carbon stocks constituting the &quot;&quot;+&quot;&quot; in REDD+) and to improve the understanding of how financial incentives for reducing greenhouse gas emissions from REDD+ can help forest countries seeking to promote rapid, large-scale investments to achieve economic development patterns that recognize the importance of forest protection, recognizing that the impact on forests can come from various sectors.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
